{"Categories":[],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[],"Id":21,"TextResource":{"Name":"bakery-co","Translations":[{"Text":"Bakery & Co","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Bakery & Co","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Lugar que mezcla sabores internacionales y tradicionales, que se complementan en una cafeter\u00eda para todos los gustos. Con opciones para comer y beber durante el desayuno, almuerzo o cena en un grato ambiente y a cualquier hora.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>International and traditional flavors complement each other at this coffee shop to cater for all tastes. Food and beverage options are available for breakfast, lunch or dinner in a pleasant atmosphere and at any time of the day.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1488916772","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/021_bakery-co.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/284\/node\/292","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/284\/node\/292","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/021_bakery-co.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/21\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/021_bakery-co.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/21\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}